This project adapts code and patterns from Omacoins
(https://github.com/bernardcosta/omarchy-omacoins), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 Bernard Costa:

- Fetcher.qml: the curl fetch discipline of MarketsFeed.qml (one request in
  flight, one queued request carrying the latest parameters, identical queued
  request dropped).
- MarketService.qml: the atomic file write of Panel.qml (mktemp in the target
  directory, then rename) and its watched FileView.
